See <a href=\"https://github.com/lbl-srg/modelica-buildings/pull/2440\">Buildings, PR #2440</a>.
</li>
<li>
April 14, 2020, by Michael Wetter:<br/>
Changed <code>homotopyInitialization</code> to a constant.<br/>
This is for
