<p>
  Performance data for Daikin FTXM20R_RXM20R for the cooling mode.
</p>
<p>
  Boundaries are for dry-bulb temperature.
</p>
<h4>References</h4>
<p>
Carrier, Water-Cooled Liquid Chillers Pro-Dialog plus, 30XW- 30XWHDaikin
